WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.834 --> 00:00:03.834
He is indeed high, Nes.

2
00:00:06.834 --> 00:00:08.834
And he is being captured.

3
00:00:23.834 --> 00:00:25.834
Can you see us like this? Yes, right?

4
00:00:26.834 --> 00:00:28.834
The question is, can you see Vanessa like this?

5
00:00:30.834 --> 00:00:49.834
I want to start by inviting God for this reflection. Maybe we can stand for a moment, right?

6
00:00:55.834 --> 00:00:57.834
Father, thank you for being here.

7
00:00:58.834 --> 00:01:00.834
Thank you for your church.

8
00:01:01.834 --> 00:01:06.834
Thank you, Lord, that every believer does not have to believe alone.

9
00:01:07.834 --> 00:01:10.834
But thank you, Jesus, that you established the church.

10
00:01:11.834 --> 00:01:17.834
This is your plan, that we come together to glorify the Father, that we come together to learn from you.

11
00:01:18.834 --> 00:01:22.834
Father, I thank you for what happened last week.

12
00:01:23.834 --> 00:01:29.834
Phenomenal, great, awe-inspiring are the words that come to mind.

13
00:01:30.834 --> 00:01:37.834
Lord, I want to ask that today everything will sink in for the people.

14
00:01:38.834 --> 00:01:40.834
Also for ourselves.

15
00:01:41.834 --> 00:01:45.834
Lord, that we will realize that you are building your church. You are at work today.

16
00:01:46.834 --> 00:01:50.834
And we give you the glory and the honor for that in the name of Jesus. Amen.

17
00:01:50.834 --> 00:01:51.834
Amen.

18
00:01:52.834 --> 00:01:54.834
Please have a seat, Jan.

19
00:01:55.834 --> 00:02:05.834
I want to start with something I was also working on last Friday, during a super cool Accelerate evening with Jian.

20
00:02:06.834 --> 00:02:12.834
And that relates again to the Pentecost weekend we had a few weeks ago.

21
00:02:12.834 --> 00:02:20.834
During Pentecost, I spoke about the fact that the Holy Spirit has come to dwell in man.

22
00:02:21.834 --> 00:02:27.834
The Father created the world, that's how you can see it. The Father created the world and He takes care of us.

23
00:02:28.834 --> 00:02:30.834
The Son came into the world to save us.

24
00:02:31.834 --> 00:02:35.834
And the Son has returned to heaven so that the Spirit can dwell in all of us.

25
00:02:35.834 --> 00:02:47.834
And the fact that on Pentecost the Spirit of God came to earth to take residence in us is wow, is great, is amazing.

26
00:02:48.834 --> 00:02:57.834
And that Sunday I said, come forward if you have a question of, I don't know if the Spirit of God is in me.

27
00:02:58.834 --> 00:03:07.834
Or come forward for prayer if you are not exactly sure what your role is within God's kingdom in your life.

28
00:03:08.834 --> 00:03:16.834
And the responses to that were quite a lot. Enough responses in any case to give a piece of teaching about it.

29
00:03:17.834 --> 00:03:20.834
That's what I wanted to talk about today. And then last week happened.

30
00:03:21.834 --> 00:03:25.834
So I will start with that first, because it is indeed in line with each other.

31
00:03:25.834 --> 00:03:33.834
When I think of the youth, we had Accelerate and I showed those circles that we are going to draw again shortly, surprise.

32
00:03:34.834 --> 00:03:40.834
And those circles personally indicate to me how my faith is structured.

33
00:03:41.834 --> 00:03:44.834
We are going to draw five circles that I once learned at Bible College.

34
00:03:45.834 --> 00:03:51.834
And this is actually how human life is structured and this is actually the model of how we may shape our faith,

35
00:03:52.834 --> 00:03:55.834
the best model I have ever seen visually.

36
00:03:56.834 --> 00:04:00.834
Chris, I would like to ask you to draw a small circle in the middle.

37
00:04:01.834 --> 00:04:03.834
Could you not center it in the middle?

38
00:04:04.834 --> 00:04:06.834
So yes, whatever.

39
00:04:07.834 --> 00:04:08.834
Not at all.

40
00:04:14.834 --> 00:04:18.834
Yes, I asked Chris because Chris is amazing with whiteboards.

41
00:04:19.834 --> 00:04:21.834
Yes, that is really true.

42
00:04:22.834 --> 00:04:24.834
To me, it would look like a triangle.

43
00:04:25.834 --> 00:04:29.834
And would you please write the word spirit in the first circle?

44
00:04:30.834 --> 00:04:31.834
Spirit.

45
00:04:35.834 --> 00:04:39.834
Around it, we will draw another circle.

46
00:04:44.834 --> 00:04:47.834
And in that, we will put the word soul.

47
00:04:49.834 --> 00:04:50.834
Soul.

48
00:04:53.834 --> 00:04:59.834
And around that circle, we will draw another circle and in that circle, we will write the word body.

49
00:05:08.834 --> 00:05:11.834
Now, these three circles, that is you.

50
00:05:12.834 --> 00:05:13.834
This is what your life looks like.

51
00:05:14.834 --> 00:05:16.834
A person is made of spirit, soul, and body.

52
00:05:17.834 --> 00:05:19.834
God who spoke, but God is spirit.

53
00:05:20.834 --> 00:05:23.834
And from the spirit of God, the natural comes forth.

54
00:05:24.834 --> 00:05:26.834
God who spoke, I want light.

55
00:05:27.834 --> 00:05:28.834
And there was light.

56
00:05:29.834 --> 00:05:31.834
God is spirit Himself, but He created the natural.

57
00:05:32.834 --> 00:05:36.834
And if you look at the first circle, you see that you yourself are a spirit.

58
00:05:37.834 --> 00:05:38.834
You are made like God.

59
00:05:39.834 --> 00:05:41.834
You are primarily a spirit.

60
00:05:42.834 --> 00:05:44.834
That is the most important part of you.

61
00:05:44.834 --> 00:05:46.834
Your spirit is more important than the other two.

62
00:05:47.834 --> 00:05:49.834
Your spirit is actually what it’s all about.

63
00:05:50.834 --> 00:05:53.834
But the spirit always has an effect on the natural.

64
00:05:54.834 --> 00:05:58.834
The spiritual always has an effect on the natural.

65
00:05:59.834 --> 00:06:02.834
God's spirit was so much love and so much creativity,

66
00:06:03.834 --> 00:06:08.834
that He spoke from His abundance of creativity and love and He created.

67
00:06:09.834 --> 00:06:12.834
It would almost be as if you say, God cannot help but create.

68
00:06:12.834 --> 00:06:14.834
It overflows.

69
00:06:15.834 --> 00:06:17.834
But around that comes another circle.

70
00:06:18.834 --> 00:06:23.834
And that circle Chris, if you draw around it, then you may put the word neighbor in it.

71
00:06:24.834 --> 00:06:25.834
Neighbor.

72
00:06:26.834 --> 00:06:27.834
The people around you.

73
00:06:28.834 --> 00:06:32.834
You know, the people around you are super important.

74
00:06:33.834 --> 00:06:39.834
And they actually form something that is very important, how you map out your faith and your happiness.

75
00:06:39.834 --> 00:06:42.834
You can become very happy from the right wife,

76
00:06:43.834 --> 00:06:47.834
but you can also become very unhappy if it is not the right wife.

77
00:06:48.834 --> 00:06:51.834
You can become very happy from the children in your class,

78
00:06:52.834 --> 00:06:57.834
you can also become very unhappy if those children in the class decide to bully you.

79
00:06:58.834 --> 00:07:00.834
So the people, the neighbors in your life,

80
00:07:01.834 --> 00:07:05.834
they are a considerable deciding factor in whether you are happy,

81
00:07:05.834 --> 00:07:06.834
or not be happy.

82
00:07:07.834 --> 00:07:10.834
Around it comes one more circle, the last circle.

83
00:07:11.834 --> 00:07:15.834
And in that last circle, we write the words situations,

84
00:07:17.834 --> 00:07:21.834
and sometimes in psychology, it is also said situations or matter.

85
00:07:24.834 --> 00:07:25.834
Situations or matter.

86
00:07:27.834 --> 00:07:32.834
Now, this model is very important to create an example here.

87
00:07:32.834 --> 00:07:38.834
The model is very important to set your eyes on and reflect on here.

88
00:07:39.834 --> 00:07:42.834
Man wants to be happy.

89
00:07:43.834 --> 00:07:46.834
For the spirit of God is happy.

90
00:07:47.834 --> 00:07:49.834
We are made by God, we have become a person,

91
00:07:50.834 --> 00:07:57.834
but our desire for happiness is actually linked to our desire to be in contact with the Most High.

92
00:07:58.834 --> 00:08:06.834
Actually, everything you exist for is to exist in a relationship with God.

93
00:08:07.834 --> 00:08:09.834
We live to be with God, that's it.

94
00:08:10.834 --> 00:08:14.834
Around it is a soul, your soul is your mind and your emotions.

95
00:08:15.834 --> 00:08:16.834
What am I going to do today?

96
00:08:17.834 --> 00:08:19.834
Am I going to do this? Am I going to do that? Am I going to take this career?

97
00:08:20.834 --> 00:08:22.834
Am I going to buy that house? Should I not buy that house? This car, and so on.

98
00:08:23.834 --> 00:08:24.834
That is your soul, your mind.

99
00:08:24.834 --> 00:08:27.834
Your body is of course your flesh and blood.

100
00:08:28.834 --> 00:08:29.834
The people around you.

101
00:08:30.834 --> 00:08:32.834
What is the trick now?

102
00:08:33.834 --> 00:08:37.834
Many people live a life where they work from the outside in.

103
00:08:38.834 --> 00:08:42.834
Many people say, if I have a good car, material things,

104
00:08:43.834 --> 00:08:47.834
or if people are nice to me in my life, my neighbors,

105
00:08:48.834 --> 00:08:53.834
or if I am 100% healthy, or if I look in the mirror and I see muscle and I look good,

106
00:08:54.834 --> 00:08:57.834
most people work from the outside in.

107
00:08:58.834 --> 00:09:02.834
But God invites us, people, to work from the inside out.

108
00:09:05.834 --> 00:09:09.834
And the church of Jesus Christ is a church, this church, I would say,

109
00:09:10.834 --> 00:09:15.834
is a training camp for your whole week, to learn on Sunday that we are spiritual people,

110
00:09:16.834 --> 00:09:19.834
and that we need to have a relationship with the Most High from the inside out.

111
00:09:19.834 --> 00:09:25.834
Because just think about it, if my body does not do what I would like it to,

112
00:09:26.834 --> 00:09:30.834
and my life is focused on working from the outside in, am I then happy?

113
00:09:31.834 --> 00:09:33.834
No, because my body does not do what I want.

114
00:09:34.834 --> 00:09:37.834
I have a painful knee, still, from a few years ago.

115
00:09:38.834 --> 00:09:42.834
My body does not like to do what I would like, and I can be very unhappy because of that.

116
00:09:43.834 --> 00:09:49.834
But, if my relationship with God, circle 1, is so strong, and so steadfast,

117
00:09:50.834 --> 00:09:55.834
that I say to myself, Lord, you are my God, and I can connect with you today,

118
00:09:56.834 --> 00:09:58.834
and I can love you as you love me,

119
00:09:59.834 --> 00:10:02.834
then it actually matters very little whether my knee gives out or not.

120
00:10:03.834 --> 00:10:08.834
Or in what car I drive, or whether the people around me in my village do not like me,

121
00:10:09.834 --> 00:10:11.834
because I believe in Jesus Christ and not in the rest.

122
00:10:12.834 --> 00:10:15.834
I work from the inside out, instead of from the outside in.

123
00:10:16.834 --> 00:10:19.834
And repentance, repentance is exactly that.

124
00:10:20.834 --> 00:10:25.834
Repentance is that you are a person who has always worked from the outside in,

125
00:10:26.834 --> 00:10:29.834
that from that day on you decide, God is spirit, He loves me,

126
00:10:30.834 --> 00:10:32.834
and from today I will work from the inside out.

127
00:10:33.834 --> 00:10:38.834
And actually, if you look at the Word of God, a spiritual book,

128
00:10:38.834 --> 00:10:42.834
then you can also understand that when you read the Bible,

129
00:10:43.834 --> 00:10:48.834
you could approach the Bible in the soul form.

130
00:10:49.834 --> 00:10:53.834
You can read the Bible in a material form, there are many letters in black and white,

131
00:10:54.834 --> 00:10:56.834
and you can read about this and learn and learn,

132
00:10:57.834 --> 00:11:00.834
but actually the Bible is meant as spiritual bread.

133
00:11:01.834 --> 00:11:03.834
So you all need to read the Bible, people.

134
00:11:04.834 --> 00:11:07.834
You need to read it, but you must not read it intellectually,

135
00:11:08.834 --> 00:11:11.834
you must read it to make a connection with God.

136
00:11:12.834 --> 00:11:13.834
I admit, that is not always easy,

137
00:11:14.834 --> 00:11:16.834
I also admit that I myself, for example, love theology very much,

138
00:11:17.834 --> 00:11:22.834
and I love to wrap my mind around how everything fits together.

139
00:11:23.834 --> 00:11:24.834
But there is a trap in that.

140
00:11:25.834 --> 00:11:26.834
You can read the Bible your whole life long,

141
00:11:27.834 --> 00:11:29.834
and be occupied with your mind your whole life long,

142
00:11:30.834 --> 00:11:31.834
and miss your connection with God.

143
00:11:32.834 --> 00:11:36.834
But God invites you to have a solid relationship with the Holy Spirit.

144
00:11:37.834 --> 00:11:39.834
Thank you, Father, for who you are.

145
00:11:40.834 --> 00:11:43.834
You are a spirit and you invite us to have a relationship with Him.

146
00:11:44.834 --> 00:11:46.834
And then Jesus came to earth,

147
00:11:47.834 --> 00:11:50.834
and He came to show us that the kingdom of God is not an earthly kingdom at all.

148
00:11:51.834 --> 00:11:54.834
People thought with matter and thought with soul,

149
00:11:55.834 --> 00:11:58.834
and thought with mind and with their bodies that Jesus would be the Messiah,

150
00:11:59.834 --> 00:12:01.834
and that He would take care of an earthly kingdom,

151
00:12:02.834 --> 00:12:04.834
but Jesus taught about a heavenly kingdom.

152
00:12:04.834 --> 00:12:06.834
Everything Jesus taught was about the spirit,

153
00:12:07.834 --> 00:12:09.834
it was not at all about the soul, or about what you had, or matter.

154
00:12:10.834 --> 00:12:11.834
Jesus didn't care at all about money.

155
00:12:12.834 --> 00:12:15.834
Do we need money? Catch a fish from the sea, there will surely be some money in it.

156
00:12:16.834 --> 00:12:19.834
So Jesus was never concerned with those outer circles.

157
00:12:20.834 --> 00:12:23.834
Jesus wanted to invite you to have a relationship in that inner circle.

158
00:12:24.834 --> 00:12:29.834
And you know people, if your inner circle is steadfast and strong together with Jesus,

159
00:12:30.834 --> 00:12:31.834
then the earth can shake beneath your feet.

160
00:12:31.834 --> 00:12:33.834
Then everyone can leave you in your life.

161
00:12:34.834 --> 00:12:37.834
Then you can have zero euros in the bank, but Jesus is your Lord.

162
00:12:38.834 --> 00:12:39.834
And that's what it's all about.

163
00:12:43.834 --> 00:12:47.834
And I actually wanted to spend half an hour on this, but I'll do it in five minutes,

164
00:12:48.834 --> 00:12:51.834
because something magnificent happened last week.

165
00:12:52.834 --> 00:12:56.834
Jesus Himself came to us during the service last week.

166
00:12:57.834 --> 00:13:03.834
And what happened last week was everything, but also everything was about what the Spirit desires from us.

167
00:13:04.834 --> 00:13:08.834
And after that service, I wrote an email to the church during that week.

168
00:13:09.834 --> 00:13:15.834
And I explained it in short words about what actually happened.

169
00:13:16.834 --> 00:13:19.834
And I have never received so many responses from all of you, reflections from people.

170
00:13:20.834 --> 00:13:24.834
I also asked for it in that email, to think about it, to engage with it this week.

171
00:13:24.834 --> 00:13:31.834
And think about okay, what spoke to you through the words that the Spirit brought through Vanessa?

172
00:13:32.834 --> 00:13:33.834
What spoke to you?

173
00:13:34.834 --> 00:13:36.834
Or what did you even find scary?

174
00:13:37.834 --> 00:13:39.834
Or what did you find uncomfortable?

175
00:13:40.834 --> 00:13:41.834
Or what did you have a question about?

176
00:13:42.834 --> 00:13:44.834
Or what was a point of repentance for you personally?

177
00:13:45.834 --> 00:13:47.834
And I really want to say thank you for all the responses.

178
00:13:48.834 --> 00:13:50.834
I have never had so many responses as last week.

179
00:13:50.834 --> 00:13:52.834
And I am happy with every response.

180
00:13:53.834 --> 00:13:55.834
And I'm sorry if I haven't responded to your response.

181
00:13:56.834 --> 00:13:59.834
For I forget your reaction the minute after.

182
00:14:00.834 --> 00:14:03.834
It goes so much, but I have written them down.

183
00:14:04.834 --> 00:14:10.834
And Vanessa and I want to talk about it today, about the main points that God has spoken about.

184
00:14:11.834 --> 00:14:15.834
My first statement that I want to make is, what happened last week was real.

185
00:14:16.834 --> 00:14:22.834
I want to approach us as a church that what happened last week was total, was real.

186
00:14:23.834 --> 00:14:30.834
And I can relate it to what the Bible also shows about what happens when the Spirit speaks through a person.

187
00:14:31.834 --> 00:14:37.834
The last book of the Bible, the book of Revelation, was characteristic of what happened last week with Vanessa.

188
00:14:37.834 --> 00:14:39.834
First of all, I want to ask Vanessa.

189
00:14:40.834 --> 00:14:45.834
Nes, can you perhaps make it clear to the church what happened to you?

190
00:14:46.834 --> 00:14:50.834
Were you present? Were you aware of what was happening?

191
00:14:51.834 --> 00:14:57.834
Or were you outside of yourself and didn't even know what was happening and woke up an hour later from a daze?

192
00:14:58.834 --> 00:15:00.834
What happened? What was your experience?

193
00:15:01.834 --> 00:15:09.834
I was fully aware and I was completely experiencing what was happening.

194
00:15:22.834 --> 00:15:29.834
I have already told a few people what happens when the Spirit comes upon you in a very manifest way

195
00:15:30.834 --> 00:15:37.834
and that He is also the Spirit who brings understanding about it.

196
00:15:37.834 --> 00:16:02.834
So it was the Spirit of God working through me, but I was fully aware and I understood very well what was happening.

197
00:16:08.834 --> 00:16:32.834
So it wasn't that I was just a conduit, I really understood what God wanted to say, one of those things was for example Romans eight, Romans eight.

198
00:16:32.834 --> 00:16:38.834
The experience is like Romans eight.

199
00:16:45.834 --> 00:16:51.834
And in Romans eight it is described that when the Spirit of God comes, He can work through you.

200
00:17:03.834 --> 00:17:13.834
To the point that you are no longer praying for someone or for the church, but that the Holy Spirit is truly praying through you for another.

201
00:17:19.834 --> 00:17:24.834
So I really felt it physically, and this is not the first time it has happened to me.

202
00:17:26.834 --> 00:17:28.834
And that is also quite clever of God.

203
00:17:29.834 --> 00:17:33.834
God is wise, even in these kinds of things.

204
00:17:41.834 --> 00:17:47.834
So it surprised me, because it happened already in the prayer quarter before the service.

205
00:17:47.834 --> 00:17:52.834
And I felt all that feeling in my stomach bubbling up about the Word I was going to bring.

206
00:17:55.834 --> 00:18:02.834
And he was already feeling all that feeling in his stomach bubbling up about the Word I was going to bring.

207
00:18:18.834 --> 00:18:26.834
So I had already asked others if they would pray for me for the Word I need to bring, because I feel that something is going on with it, that God wants to do something with it.

208
00:18:26.834 --> 00:18:31.834
And yes, of course, I couldn't know that he wanted to tell it himself.

209
00:18:33.834 --> 00:18:36.834
I want to give a reflection on that.

210
00:18:40.834 --> 00:18:46.834
Maybe you looked at me during that service about how I behave in such a moment.

211
00:18:47.834 --> 00:18:59.834
And I want to give a piece of teaching to the church, that if you deal with this and you think you need to respond with your mind or your body, then it goes the wrong way.

212
00:19:00.834 --> 00:19:10.834
I want to indicate that during all the words that Vanessa was speaking about the church, I was silent and listening to what the Spirit has to say.

213
00:19:10.834 --> 00:19:18.834
It is not necessary that at such a moment you start thinking to yourself, okay, the Holy Spirit is working with Vanessa, I need to do that too.

214
00:19:18.834 --> 00:19:25.834
I need to respond to that and then suddenly you start doing strange things with your hands or you start moving around.

215
00:19:25.834 --> 00:19:26.834
That is not necessary.

216
00:19:26.834 --> 00:19:34.834
What the Spirit decides to do with someone is the decision of the Lord in His wisdom to do with Vanessa at that moment.

217
00:19:34.834 --> 00:19:41.834
There are other moments in the church where the Lord does challenge you to give yourself completely.

218
00:19:41.834 --> 00:19:42.834
That is during worship.

219
00:19:42.834 --> 00:19:57.834
During worship, God asks us, kneel, stretch out your hands, sing loudly, even if you never sing, dance, do something extraordinarily beautiful for the Lord, because the Lord is also extraordinarily beautiful for you.

220
00:19:57.834 --> 00:20:03.834
But worship is something very different than the moment when the Spirit of God comes to visit us to speak to us.

221
00:20:03.834 --> 00:20:14.834
When the King of kings starts to speak to me last week, I stand still and listen so that I can bind all the words spoken in my heart.

222
00:20:14.834 --> 00:20:28.834
So I am not busy with my soul nor am I busy with my body to start waving or shouting along, because that would actually be a wrong way to respond to the Spirit.

223
00:20:28.834 --> 00:20:39.834
Now, if the Spirit touches you at that moment to bring you healing through the words that are spoken, then it is different of course.

224
00:20:39.834 --> 00:20:42.834
You may have cried last week.

225
00:20:42.834 --> 00:20:45.834
You may have thought to yourself, wow, what should I do with this?

226
00:20:45.834 --> 00:20:47.834
You may have experienced freedom.

227
00:20:47.834 --> 00:20:53.834
But God invites us at such a moment to be a church that listens to the words of the Lord.

228
00:20:53.834 --> 00:21:05.834
In the book of Revelation, it says that when the Lord speaks and we listen and obey and the words do what Jesus has said, then we receive the right to etcetera etcetera.

229
00:21:05.834 --> 00:21:07.834
Amen? Amen.

230
00:21:07.834 --> 00:21:16.834
Now, perhaps Vanessa you can talk about the first subject that was spoken through you.

231
00:21:16.834 --> 00:21:20.834
The first subject was follow me, said Jesus.

232
00:21:20.834 --> 00:21:22.834
Follow me, Vanessa.

233
00:21:23.834 --> 00:21:36.834
During the worship, I was still lying on the ground and it became very clear to me.

234
00:21:43.834 --> 00:21:48.834
The presence of God was so heavy upon me that I just could not stand up.

235
00:21:53.834 --> 00:21:59.834
At that moment, God made something clear to me and it was about following Him.

236
00:21:59.834 --> 00:22:26.834
And when the Holy Spirit was giving those kinds of things through me, there were intense moments and this was one of those very intense moments.

237
00:22:29.834 --> 00:22:52.834
And He made it very clear that you cannot do this alone or achieve it by yourself and it is also described in the gospel that He emphasizes follow me.

238
00:22:56.834 --> 00:22:58.834
He did not say grow, He says follow.

239
00:23:00.834 --> 00:23:06.834
And when we say, Jesus is the way, the truth, and the life,

240
00:23:17.834 --> 00:23:27.834
and when we say that, He is the way, the truth, and the life, then that is also what we do, we follow Him in that way, in that truth, in the Word, and in the life.

241
00:23:30.834 --> 00:23:37.834
So you cannot reach that life if you do not follow Him, that is the only way.

242
00:23:45.834 --> 00:23:50.834
That was the first word that was repeated in repetition.

243
00:23:59.834 --> 00:24:26.834
And sometimes we say, yes you need to grow and this and that, but this was a very important point that the Holy Spirit brought forward, that no, you need to follow me and then you will grow from that.

244
00:24:29.834 --> 00:24:44.834
So when Jesus says, follow me, then you need to think to yourself, for example, when you look at the book of Revelation, what is a piece of criticism that Jesus has in His love for us as a church.

245
00:24:45.834 --> 00:25:05.834
When you read what Jesus writes to the first seven churches in the book of Revelation, for example, Jesus says to Laodicea, guys you are doing quite well, you are rich, you are well organized, but actually you are cold, you are lukewarm, you are actually nothing, because you have lost your love.

246
00:25:05.834 --> 00:25:25.834
Well in this way in His love, Jesus said last week, you need to follow me, because you know, I have learned, you can come to this church for 35 years and you can serve here and you can be here in this church, you can understand it all, but you can miss your relationship with Jesus.

247
00:25:26.834 --> 00:25:40.834
And that is why Jesus said last week in a radical way, when Vanessa was on her knees, follow me and that hit me enormously, this part was the most radical for me.

248
00:25:41.834 --> 00:25:51.834
Paul even says at one point that he is preaching the Word and that he even has to be careful that he does not lose his own salvation within his own work.

249
00:25:52.834 --> 00:26:00.834
In other words, Paul is such a great man in Christ, such an apostle of God and we will meet him later in heaven, I am sure of that.

250
00:26:00.834 --> 00:26:10.834
But Paul realizes very well, the work that I do is secondary to that love and that relationship that I have and that I must cherish together with Jesus.

251
00:26:11.834 --> 00:26:17.834
And that is why Jesus says church, Christian center Rehoboth, you are doing well, but keep following me.

252
00:26:18.834 --> 00:26:28.834
Do not be concerned with the lights and the music and what we are all going to do and the creativity, even though it is all wonderful, but it must work from the inside out again.

253
00:26:29.834 --> 00:26:34.834
And everything we do in creativity and even the money you give to Madagascar, think about this.

254
00:26:35.834 --> 00:26:42.834
If you give money to Madagascar because you think to yourself, then I am doing something good, then you might miss the Spirit.

255
00:26:43.834 --> 00:26:51.834
But God invites us to follow Him, to do what He says, to follow Him in the Spirit. Amen?

256
00:26:52.834 --> 00:27:07.834
The next thing God spoke about is, and I have had certain reactions about this, that is why it is good that we pause and talk about it, is the words, you are my possession.

257
00:27:08.834 --> 00:27:20.834
I owe you, said Jesus. I own you. And He kept going on about it, maybe for 10 minutes, Jesus kept saying, you are mine.

258
00:27:21.834 --> 00:27:28.834
And thank you for your reactions, because we need to continue on this, maybe Vanessa you can share some words about it first?

259
00:27:28.834 --> 00:27:57.834
When I spoke these words, I experienced the Holy Spirit very intensely. I just felt that this was something important that was on His heart and that He wanted to share.

260
00:27:58.834 --> 00:28:27.834
So Jesus paid a price, He bought us. The Bible also speaks about that, that He redeemed us, paid a ransom.

261
00:28:28.834 --> 00:28:43.834
If you do not know your Bible well, this can come across very harshly.

262
00:28:43.834 --> 00:28:53.834
Because it is spiritual language, it has nothing to do with the natural, it is spiritual.

263
00:28:53.834 --> 00:29:02.834
That is very confronting in the natural, in your flesh, because your body or your flesh wants to have control.

264
00:29:02.834 --> 00:29:15.834
But if you are in Christ, you are no longer your own. You are no longer your own.

265
00:29:15.834 --> 00:29:23.834
So he said, you are mine, I possess you and that is all true.

266
00:29:28.834 --> 00:29:44.834
And if you know who the Holy Spirit is in the Scriptures, then the sign that you have been redeemed by the blood and are in Christ.

267
00:29:44.834 --> 00:29:48.834
And the sign of that is that he has given you his Holy Spirit.

268
00:29:52.834 --> 00:29:56.834
And Paul also says, he is the confirmation of your salvation.

269
00:29:56.834 --> 00:30:19.834
So the Holy Spirit is a seal that is placed on you of ownership, that you are owned by Jesus, that you belong to him.

270
00:30:26.834 --> 00:30:32.834
And the next day I realized that God had been preparing all of this, right from that prayer meeting in the morning.

271
00:30:42.834 --> 00:30:52.834
So in that morning of prayer, the Holy Spirit was already leading me to pray, open the doors, make a way, so that the King can come in.

272
00:30:52.834 --> 00:30:59.834
And I knew it was from the Psalms, but I did not know exactly which one at that moment.

273
00:31:06.834 --> 00:31:14.834
But that day I was listening to worship and then a song with that text came on the radio.

274
00:31:15.834 --> 00:31:29.834
And then, I had never heard that song before, but it said exactly those words of open the doors, open the gates, let the King come in.

275
00:31:30.834 --> 00:31:47.834
And I said to Tim, what? And I jumped up from the couch and I said, these are the words I have prayed, I need to look up those Psalms now.

276
00:31:48.834 --> 00:31:50.834
Psalms 24.

277
00:31:52.834 --> 00:31:54.834
If you read it in its entirety, from front to back,

278
00:31:59.834 --> 00:32:05.834
it ends with those words, that psalm, but the whole psalm is actually that message from the Lord.

279
00:32:10.834 --> 00:32:14.834
For it begins with, everything in the world belongs to the Lord.

280
00:32:15.834 --> 00:32:17.834
And everyone who lives in it.

281
00:32:28.834 --> 00:32:35.834
And then it continues about how we can approach God on that mountain? And then He says, you must have a pure heart, clean hands.

282
00:32:35.834 --> 00:32:40.834
And then He says, open the doors, open the gates, so that He can come in.

283
00:32:52.834 --> 00:32:57.834
And that is actually a kind of summary of every point He tried to make.

284
00:33:01.834 --> 00:33:04.834
So read that psalm once, psalm 24.

285
00:33:06.834 --> 00:33:21.834
It comes down to the fact that if you belong to Jesus, then Jesus is so happy that you belong to Him, that you are part of Him.

286
00:33:22.834 --> 00:33:28.834
And if those words of, you are my possession, have touched you or seemed a bit sensitive,

287
00:33:28.834 --> 00:33:31.834
then it is important that you know your Bible well.

288
00:33:31.834 --> 00:33:36.834
And, I also want to say, you really do not want to be someone else's possession.

289
00:33:39.834 --> 00:33:43.834
One of the reactions from the people who are here is that the people who are here,

290
00:33:43.834 --> 00:33:48.834
I also want to say, you really do not want to be someone else's possession.

291
00:33:50.834 --> 00:33:55.834
One of the reactions was, an email or a WhatsApp, I don't remember exactly what it was,

292
00:33:55.834 --> 00:34:01.834
but one of the reactions was the following question, how can I then on the one hand be the possession of the Father,

293
00:34:01.834 --> 00:34:06.834
be a slave of Jesus, or be a child, or a friend.

294
00:34:06.834 --> 00:34:10.834
So the Bible speaks about multiple concepts.

295
00:34:10.834 --> 00:34:16.834
And I have learned, and I feel myself, and I believe myself, that you often shouldn't try to cram the different truths of God,

296
00:34:16.834 --> 00:34:22.834
like a carbon copy, like sheets on top of each other,

297
00:34:22.834 --> 00:34:25.834
and then think, there can only be one truth.

298
00:34:25.834 --> 00:34:33.834
God is so great, He is so powerful, that you can talk about this, philosophize about it,

299
00:34:33.834 --> 00:34:39.834
and write about it as the apostles did, until the end of your life, until you meet Jesus,

300
00:34:39.834 --> 00:34:42.834
and even then you have not fully explained God.

301
00:34:42.834 --> 00:34:44.834
He is so powerful, He is so great.

302
00:34:44.834 --> 00:34:46.834
What Jesus has done for me.

303
00:34:46.834 --> 00:34:49.834
I personally do not understand why there are different denominations,

304
00:34:49.834 --> 00:34:52.834
so the Catholic church, the Protestant church, the Reformed church,

305
00:34:52.834 --> 00:34:54.834
I do not understand why all those churches exist,

306
00:34:54.834 --> 00:35:00.834
because all those churches have their perspective on what Jesus has done for us on the cross.

307
00:35:00.834 --> 00:35:04.834
And one looks at it this way, and the other looks at it that way, and the other looks at it another way.

308
00:35:04.834 --> 00:35:08.834
And I always think to myself, yes that is true because they are all true.

309
00:35:08.834 --> 00:35:10.834
Jesus has paid for me.

310
00:35:10.834 --> 00:35:12.834
He has redeemed me.

311
00:35:12.834 --> 00:35:15.834
And on the other hand, He is also my big brother.

312
00:35:15.834 --> 00:35:17.834
He has done the things I could not do.

313
00:35:17.834 --> 00:35:20.834
And they are different perspectives, and in that way,

314
00:35:20.834 --> 00:35:24.834
Jesus is both my big brother,

315
00:35:24.834 --> 00:35:28.834
and at the same time, I can also be His slave.

316
00:35:28.834 --> 00:35:34.834
If Jesus says to me, Tim you are going to China now to do missionary work,

317
00:35:34.834 --> 00:35:35.834
then I will go.

318
00:35:35.834 --> 00:35:37.834
I will take Vanessa with me and then I will go.

319
00:35:37.834 --> 00:35:39.834
Why? Yes, of course.

320
00:35:39.834 --> 00:35:41.834
I am not going alone.

321
00:35:41.834 --> 00:35:43.834
That's not so strange.

322
00:35:43.834 --> 00:35:46.834
But so, and Paul, this is also a very beautiful one.

323
00:35:46.834 --> 00:35:48.834
This is a very beautiful reflection.

324
00:35:48.834 --> 00:35:50.834
Paul comes to repentance.

325
00:35:50.834 --> 00:35:52.834
Is thrown off his horse.

326
00:35:52.834 --> 00:35:54.834
Comes to repentance.

327
00:35:54.834 --> 00:35:57.834
And in the beginning he writes a letter to the Galatians.

328
00:35:57.834 --> 00:36:01.834
And that is quite early in his repentance that he is an apostle.

329
00:36:01.834 --> 00:36:06.834
And then he says to the Galatians, I am Paul, I am indeed an apostle of the Lord.

330
00:36:06.834 --> 00:36:09.834
And then he emphasizes his authority enormously.

331
00:36:09.834 --> 00:36:11.834
I am indeed Paul, an apostle of the Lord.

332
00:36:11.834 --> 00:36:15.834
But later in his life he writes another letter to another church.

333
00:36:15.834 --> 00:36:19.834
And then he says, I am Paul, the least among the apostles.

334
00:36:19.834 --> 00:36:21.834
Alright, alright.

335
00:36:21.834 --> 00:36:22.834
And that is later.

336
00:36:22.834 --> 00:36:28.834
Later he says, I am Paul, he arrives, the worst among all sinners.

337
00:36:28.834 --> 00:36:34.834
And there you actually see that the same Paul is growing in his relationship with God.

338
00:36:34.834 --> 00:36:38.834
And at the same time he has received another kind of revelation.

339
00:36:38.834 --> 00:36:41.834
One day I feel like a royal child.

340
00:36:41.834 --> 00:36:44.834
And the next day I feel like...

341
00:36:46.834 --> 00:36:48.834
And it is all true.

342
00:36:48.834 --> 00:36:54.834
For I am both a broken earthen vessel made of clay and I am broken.

343
00:36:54.834 --> 00:36:56.834
And at the same time, I am a child of the King.

344
00:36:56.834 --> 00:36:58.834
And that is how it works with the Bible.

345
00:36:58.834 --> 00:37:03.834
So I want to advise you that when you hear the words, you are my possession.

346
00:37:03.834 --> 00:37:07.834
Then you reflect on the words that, for example, the letter to the Romans says.

347
00:37:07.834 --> 00:37:10.834
And a Corinthian also writes about it, you are my possession.

348
00:37:10.834 --> 00:37:12.834
I have paid for you.

349
00:37:12.834 --> 00:37:15.834
And then I think to myself, thank you Jesus that you have paid for me.

350
00:37:15.834 --> 00:37:22.834
Thank you that you have paid for me with your blood, so that I may be your child and also your servant.

351
00:37:22.834 --> 00:37:24.834
I don't care, send me, let it be.

352
00:37:25.834 --> 00:37:27.834
I am his possession.

353
00:37:27.834 --> 00:37:29.834
Glory to the King.

354
00:37:30.834 --> 00:37:34.834
I just want to say that it is in combination with the first.

355
00:37:34.834 --> 00:37:38.834
Because he says, you belong to me, follow me.

356
00:37:38.834 --> 00:37:40.834
Follow me.

357
00:37:40.834 --> 00:37:42.834
So those two go together.

358
00:37:42.834 --> 00:37:46.834
He says, you are mine, so follow me.

359
00:37:46.834 --> 00:37:50.834
So it is a real passion for us as a church, individually, but as a church.

360
00:37:50.834 --> 00:37:52.834
We are his, we belong to him.

361
00:37:52.834 --> 00:37:55.834
We are the woman he is returning to.

362
00:37:55.834 --> 00:37:56.834
Follow him.

363
00:37:56.834 --> 00:38:00.834
He was very passionate about this, that we as a church are his bride.

364
00:38:00.834 --> 00:38:03.834
And when he returns, he says, follow me as well.

365
00:38:09.834 --> 00:38:14.834
And when he comes in a greater measure or in greater glory,

366
00:38:20.834 --> 00:38:24.834
it is important that he finds a pure bride.

367
00:38:24.834 --> 00:38:26.834
Not perfect, but pure.

368
00:38:26.834 --> 00:38:28.834
And there is a big difference in that.

369
00:38:36.834 --> 00:38:40.834
Pure means that you follow him with a pure heart.

370
00:38:42.834 --> 00:38:44.834
And that does not go perfectly.

371
00:38:48.834 --> 00:38:52.834
But it is about the purity of your heart that you are truly seeking Jesus.

372
00:38:52.834 --> 00:38:55.834
I received a very nice response via email from someone.

373
00:38:55.834 --> 00:38:58.834
And that person said very beautifully,

374
00:38:58.834 --> 00:39:02.834
I am always busy with Jesus, also with my family, also with my job,

375
00:39:02.834 --> 00:39:06.834
and even something for the kingdom of God, outside these four walls of this church.

376
00:39:06.834 --> 00:39:10.834
And this person said, and I am working on it, and I am working on it, I am working on it,

377
00:39:10.834 --> 00:39:13.834
until the words of the Lord penetrated me.

378
00:39:13.834 --> 00:39:19.834
And said, I need to make time for the Lord himself.

379
00:39:19.834 --> 00:39:24.834
Because you can do all sorts of things and you can fill your whole life with all kinds of things.

380
00:39:24.834 --> 00:39:26.834
And that person said, I must.

381
00:39:26.834 --> 00:39:31.834
And that was a piece of repentance at a wonderful time by granting yourself rest.

382
00:39:31.834 --> 00:39:36.834
So I want to indicate with this, possessing Jesus.

383
00:39:36.834 --> 00:39:39.834
Or following Jesus is not a heavy burden, church.

384
00:39:39.834 --> 00:39:42.834
It is wonderful. It is saving.

385
00:39:42.834 --> 00:39:47.834
It makes you happy. It puts you on a peaceful path, but also on a protective path.

386
00:39:47.834 --> 00:39:52.834
If He is your master, then you are protected in the very best way.

387
00:39:52.834 --> 00:39:54.834
Follow Jesus.

388
00:39:54.834 --> 00:39:59.834
Okay, and the last topic that the Spirit spoke about through Vanessa,

389
00:39:59.834 --> 00:40:04.834
I have also received feedback on that, and that was about the leadership of the church.

390
00:40:04.834 --> 00:40:08.834
And Vanessa, before I give you the floor,

391
00:40:08.834 --> 00:40:14.834
I want to indicate that I once had a conversation with one of my mentors in Australia.

392
00:40:14.834 --> 00:40:19.834
And this mentor, a pastor, sometimes travels around the world.

393
00:40:19.834 --> 00:40:23.834
And whenever he returns from a trip to Europe,

394
00:40:23.834 --> 00:40:26.834
he always comes home with the same conclusion.

395
00:40:26.834 --> 00:40:33.834
And I said to him, I said, Ian, explain, what is going on with Europe?

396
00:40:33.834 --> 00:40:39.834
And he always said the same thing. He said, Europe, the church in Europe is often dying,

397
00:40:39.834 --> 00:40:46.834
many churches are dying in Europe, due to the lack of understanding of what leadership is in the church.

398
00:40:46.834 --> 00:40:51.834
Because, namely, Europe is prosperous, and everyone is smart, and everyone is rich,

399
00:40:51.834 --> 00:40:54.834
and everyone has everything, and there is democracy.

400
00:40:54.834 --> 00:40:58.834
But democracy within the church means, I do not agree with this,

401
00:40:58.834 --> 00:41:00.834
then we are just not going to do it beautifully.

402
00:41:00.834 --> 00:41:02.834
Or, no, I think we should approach it this way.

403
00:41:02.834 --> 00:41:04.834
Or someone says, no, we need to go that way.

404
00:41:04.834 --> 00:41:08.834
And when you see a church, as explained by my mentor,

405
00:41:08.834 --> 00:41:12.834
if it is a church that does not operate in an apostolic way,

406
00:41:12.834 --> 00:41:16.834
it won't be long before it ultimately falls apart.

407
00:41:16.834 --> 00:41:20.834
God has given a way in the Bible by appointing leaders.

408
00:41:20.834 --> 00:41:22.834
And actually, it has been this way as long as the Bible is old.

409
00:41:22.834 --> 00:41:25.834
Moses was a leader over the people of Israel.

410
00:41:25.834 --> 00:41:28.834
Where else were they supposed to go through the desert?

411
00:41:28.834 --> 00:41:31.834
If a few million men start saying, yes, I'm going that way, and I'm going that way,

412
00:41:31.834 --> 00:41:33.834
the people of God would be destroyed.

413
00:41:33.834 --> 00:41:35.834
You must follow a leader.

414
00:41:35.834 --> 00:41:36.834
Vanessa.

415
00:41:44.834 --> 00:41:48.834
And this was also such a super intense moment, you surely noticed that.

416
00:41:50.834 --> 00:41:52.834
And that was again that passion of God.

417
00:41:54.834 --> 00:41:58.834
That He desired His church to agree with this.

418
00:41:58.834 --> 00:42:06.834
With whom He Himself has appointed as leader. Tim.

419
00:42:11.834 --> 00:42:13.834
And it has to do with honor.

420
00:42:14.834 --> 00:42:18.834
It is true, democracy around the world causes many problems,

421
00:42:18.834 --> 00:42:22.834
but it is the misunderstanding, a sense of honor.

422
00:42:22.834 --> 00:42:26.834
What honor is, and what it does.

423
00:42:36.834 --> 00:42:41.834
For this is how the kingdom works, after all.

424
00:42:44.834 --> 00:42:47.834
Blessing flows through honor.

425
00:42:53.834 --> 00:42:58.834
And blessing is released when you honor someone.

426
00:43:01.834 --> 00:43:04.834
You have been doing this for a long time, so just believe me.

427
00:43:05.834 --> 00:43:09.834
I have already spoken to some people as examples, but if you have a problem,

428
00:43:14.834 --> 00:43:18.834
and you ask people for input or for an idea or a solution,

429
00:43:18.834 --> 00:43:21.834
for example, even if you say, I have broken my tooth, where should I go?

430
00:43:22.834 --> 00:43:25.834
And if my tooth is broken, I don't just go to anyone,

431
00:43:25.834 --> 00:43:28.834
I go to a dentist, because they have the solution I need.

432
00:43:35.834 --> 00:43:38.834
So at that moment, you honor that solution.

433
00:43:41.834 --> 00:43:43.834
And then that is the solution.

434
00:43:44.834 --> 00:43:49.834
So at that moment, you honor, you respect that dentist in his or her role,

435
00:43:56.834 --> 00:43:58.834
because they have what you need.

436
00:44:00.834 --> 00:44:04.834
And then you also receive the gift of, the favor of, the benefit of that.

437
00:44:08.834 --> 00:44:12.834
All the years they spent in school to become a dentist.

438
00:44:13.834 --> 00:44:16.834
The skills they have learned,

439
00:44:18.834 --> 00:44:20.834
you receive at that moment.

440
00:44:22.834 --> 00:44:24.834
And this is how honoring works.

441
00:44:26.834 --> 00:44:28.834
And when we honor Tim,

442
00:44:36.834 --> 00:44:39.834
we are actually saying to the Lord, Lord we honor, we respect

443
00:44:39.834 --> 00:44:43.834
the one you have appointed to guide us here.

444
00:44:49.834 --> 00:44:53.834
And some people say yes, I don't need a leader, I follow Jesus.

445
00:44:53.834 --> 00:44:56.834
You know, but that doesn't really make sense at all.

446
00:44:58.834 --> 00:45:00.834
Because Jesus is still spirit.

447
00:45:02.834 --> 00:45:05.834
And the Lord works through leadership.

448
00:45:10.834 --> 00:45:14.834
So for the blessing of the whole church, for everyone, God has appointed leaders.

449
00:45:19.834 --> 00:45:21.834
So when you honor Tim,

450
00:45:22.834 --> 00:45:24.834
And actually you are already doing this.

451
00:45:27.834 --> 00:45:31.834
You just know that if I have a problem or a question, I just go to Tim.

452
00:45:31.834 --> 00:45:36.834
And then you also know, you expect that he will come up with something that you need at that moment.

453
00:45:36.834 --> 00:45:39.834
Because you know it has been given to him by God.

454
00:45:44.834 --> 00:45:48.834
So if you have a problem or a question, you just go to Tim.

455
00:45:48.834 --> 00:45:51.834
Because you know it has been given to him by God.

456
00:46:03.834 --> 00:46:08.834
Maybe you can still remember that Tim was standing here on the side and that the spirit said,

457
00:46:08.834 --> 00:46:13.834
I have appointed you, I have appointed you, no one else has appointed you but I.

458
00:46:19.834 --> 00:46:28.834
And God wanted the church to respond affirmatively, by saying yes and amen,

459
00:46:28.834 --> 00:46:33.834
to the fact that he had made the choice to appoint Tim.

460
00:46:33.834 --> 00:46:52.834
So at that moment we were called by the Holy Spirit to confirm yes and amen,

461
00:46:52.834 --> 00:46:57.834
the choice of God to appoint Tim to lead us.

462
00:46:59.834 --> 00:47:01.834
And that is only for the good.

463
00:47:04.834 --> 00:47:10.834
And that is only for the good to be able to lead for what God wants to do.

464
00:47:10.834 --> 00:47:16.834
One of the reactions, and thank you for such an honest reaction, because I really appreciate that,

465
00:47:16.834 --> 00:47:22.834
because when someone sends me that reaction, then multiple people live with it.

466
00:47:22.834 --> 00:47:27.834
And I want to respond to that reaction, and one of those reactions was,

467
00:47:27.834 --> 00:47:34.834
but Tim, we accept leadership, but do we then have to put you on a pedestal?

468
00:47:34.834 --> 00:47:36.834
What does it mean to honor?

469
00:47:36.834 --> 00:47:43.834
And I want to indicate, there is a big difference between honoring someone and venerating someone.

470
00:47:43.834 --> 00:47:48.834
I am not asking at all for people to venerate me or Vanessa.

471
00:47:48.834 --> 00:47:54.834
I do ask that people recognize that what Vanessa and I are allowed to do is serve this church.

472
00:47:54.834 --> 00:48:01.834
So if I call a plumber, I understand that the plumber comes to help me as Vanessa just explained.

473
00:48:01.834 --> 00:48:07.834
The other thing I really want to promise or explain is,

474
00:48:07.834 --> 00:48:15.834
I truly do everything I can to honor others in this church for the positions that God has assigned to them.

475
00:48:15.834 --> 00:48:22.834
I really try to make it all about creating a culture in this church where we have a culture of encouragement,

476
00:48:22.834 --> 00:48:25.834
respect, and gratitude.

477
00:48:25.834 --> 00:48:28.834
That is really seriously everything I want to live for.

478
00:48:35.834 --> 00:48:41.834
I am just a human and I can really go wrong in my life.

479
00:48:41.834 --> 00:48:48.834
But recently we have, and we will come back to that, I have positioned people around me,

480
00:48:48.834 --> 00:48:56.834
a board of people I have positioned around me who ensure that I continue to walk the straight path with God.

481
00:48:56.834 --> 00:49:02.834
I do not see it as healthy if I were to be a sole ruler, a dictator of a church,

482
00:49:02.834 --> 00:49:08.834
and that I would say this is how it must be and that's it, and that there would never be any control over me.

483
00:49:08.834 --> 00:49:14.834
So if I preach from this podium and at some point in a few years I am no longer engaged with the Bible,

484
00:49:14.834 --> 00:49:20.834
or my character begins to change from encouraging and respectful towards people

485
00:49:20.834 --> 00:49:25.834
and I were to become a dictator in my speech saying this is how it must be and you are bad.

486
00:49:25.834 --> 00:49:32.834
Then there need to be people in place, whom I also respect, who will say,

487
00:49:32.834 --> 00:49:37.834
Tim, we need to have a cup of coffee because you are going to get some backlash this afternoon.

488
00:49:37.834 --> 00:49:43.834
But I mean it seriously, I find it very important and at the same time I also find it wonderful to see

489
00:49:44.834 --> 00:49:52.834
Fonja who is doing the children's work, Bjorn who is involved with the youth, Chris who is engaged in prayer.

490
00:49:52.834 --> 00:49:58.834
I cannot do this without you. We are in this together, we are together the church of Jesus Christ

491
00:49:58.834 --> 00:50:03.834
and we must honor each other together and that is again what the Bible says.

492
00:50:03.834 --> 00:50:08.834
Everyone should consider themselves less than others. That is what the Bible says.

493
00:50:08.834 --> 00:50:13.834
In other words, it is a command from God that we all honor each other.

494
00:50:13.834 --> 00:50:18.834
We must honor each other, we are a team and we all want Kemper to come to repentance.

495
00:50:18.834 --> 00:50:22.834
Let me then do my part by saying guys we are going that way.

496
00:50:22.834 --> 00:50:28.834
This is the word we believe as this church. We are going that way, that is what we will do

497
00:50:28.834 --> 00:50:34.834
and then we can all honor each other by doing that work together. Amen.

498
00:50:39.834 --> 00:50:45.834
May I invite the band because we are going to conclude.

499
00:50:45.834 --> 00:50:52.834
Thank you all for your attention. The best part of all was the responses that came to us

500
00:50:52.834 --> 00:51:00.834
that were mainly about I am going to work on this and I want to make more room for God.

501
00:51:00.834 --> 00:51:03.834
Those are the most beautiful responses and thank you for those responses.

502
00:51:03.834 --> 00:51:10.834
I have had people send me responses saying I still allow myself to be enslaved by this in my life.

503
00:51:10.834 --> 00:51:14.834
But I want to be the possession of Jesus so I will work on that.

504
00:51:14.834 --> 00:51:21.834
Or people who say I want to make time for God or people who say I want to learn more about God.

505
00:51:21.834 --> 00:51:30.834
And that is a wonderful response and what Jesus was working on last week is for the building up of His church.

506
00:51:30.834 --> 00:51:33.834
That is what the Spirit of God is working on.

507
00:51:33.834 --> 00:51:41.834
Sometimes we pray here as a church and we pray Lord bring the Kempen to repentance through us.

508
00:51:41.834 --> 00:51:49.834
And every time I come to the realization that we will not do that ourselves if we do not have the approval and the blessing of the Lord.

509
00:51:49.834 --> 00:51:56.834
And how beautiful it is when Jesus Himself comes to visit and He gives us instructions on how we can live with Him.

510
00:51:56.834 --> 00:52:00.834
Shall we stand and honor Him by singing to Him?

511
00:52:00.834 --> 00:52:04.834
And I just want to say people, keep going with God.

512
00:52:04.834 --> 00:52:11.834
I want to really recommend one thing and I think this is very important.

513
00:52:11.834 --> 00:52:15.834
Yes, it came in the words, I am not completely sure anymore.

514
00:52:15.834 --> 00:52:21.834
But I often notice when I talk to people that it gets better and better.

515
00:52:21.834 --> 00:52:26.834
But I often notice that we Christians read our Bibles too little.

516
00:52:26.834 --> 00:52:29.834
And I want to encourage all of us.

517
00:52:29.834 --> 00:52:35.834
A relationship with God can be found in three very simple concepts.

518
00:52:35.834 --> 00:52:39.834
Your Word, prayer, and worship.

519
00:52:39.834 --> 00:52:41.834
I say it again.

520
00:52:41.834 --> 00:52:45.834
If you want to have a relationship with Jesus, there are three pillars that are very important.

521
00:52:45.834 --> 00:52:49.834
The Bible, prayer and worship.

522
00:52:49.834 --> 00:52:53.834
Without worship, you cannot build a relationship with Jesus.

523
00:52:53.834 --> 00:52:57.834
If you don't get up this morning and say thank you Jesus for another new day.

524
00:52:57.834 --> 00:53:00.834
Thank you Lord for my job that I have received from You.

525
00:53:00.834 --> 00:53:05.834
Thank you for the money that I have available in my life to do good things with it.

526
00:53:05.834 --> 00:53:08.834
Worship is important to have a relationship with God.

527
00:53:08.834 --> 00:53:10.834
Praying is also important.

528
00:53:10.834 --> 00:53:13.834
Who should you turn to when you have problems?

529
00:53:13.834 --> 00:53:15.834
Then you should turn to the King of Kings.

530
00:53:15.834 --> 00:53:18.834
You need to talk to Him, but not only for problems.

531
00:53:18.834 --> 00:53:20.834
Also for wonderful things.

532
00:53:20.834 --> 00:53:22.834
Thank you Jesus for what You are doing with your church.

533
00:53:22.834 --> 00:53:24.834
And the last is very important.

534
00:53:24.834 --> 00:53:26.834
Read your Word church.

535
00:53:26.834 --> 00:53:28.834
Read the Bible.

536
00:53:28.834 --> 00:53:30.834
This every day is an old song.

537
00:53:30.834 --> 00:53:32.834
But read the Bible.

538
00:53:32.834 --> 00:53:36.834
And I want to emphasize, you don't have to read three, four, five chapters a day.

539
00:53:36.834 --> 00:53:39.834
I personally read one chapter a day.

540
00:53:39.834 --> 00:53:43.834
So that I can have one chapter well in my mind and carry it through the day.

541
00:53:43.834 --> 00:53:47.834
One chapter a day is better than any food at all.

542
00:53:47.834 --> 00:53:48.834
Amen.

543
00:53:48.834 --> 00:53:50.834
Let us follow Jesus, church.
